Third-party components
----------------------
Gextto includes code derived from permissively licensed projects (gx-core in
internal/gxcore, MIT; the DHT in internal/dht, BSD-3-Clause and MIT) and links
third-party Go modules; the optional GEXTTO_LIBTORRENT=1 build also links
libtorrent-rasterbar (BSD-3-Clause) and Boost (Boost Software License 1.0).

THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES lists every one of them with its copyright notice and
licence text. It ships in every package and is shown on the Licence page of
the web interface.
